"apply it some other way, such as in a page you embedded yourself, pass "
"``send=False`` and hand the returned message, serialized with "
":func:`pyvista_js.rendering.scene_to_json`, to "
"``window.pvjsApplyUpdate(plotter.container_id, message)`` in the page."
